  "description": "The Bouncy Graffiti Font is a high-energy display typeface that brings the rhythm and flow of the streets to your creative projects. Featuring bold, interlocking silhouettes and iconic “over-under” interlaced details, this design captures the classic 90s graffiti “throw-up” style. It is the ultimate choice for urban streetwear branding, skate shop logos, vibrant vinyl stickers, and edgy social media headlines.\nEach character is meticulously hand-drawn with playful flourishes and varying weights, giving every word a custom-painted, mural-like personality. Whether you are a digital artist designing high-impact thumbnails or a crafter creating custom apparel, the Bouncy Graffiti Font delivers a professional, artisan-crafted aesthetic that is both nostalgic and trend-forward.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>The Bouncy Graffiti Font is a high-energy display typeface that brings the rhythm and flow of the streets to your creative projects. Featuring bold, interlocking silhouettes and iconic “over-under” interlaced details, this design captures the classic 90s graffiti “throw-up” style. It is the ultimate choice for urban streetwear branding, skate shop logos, vibrant vinyl stickers, and edgy social media headlines.</p>\n<p>Each character is meticulously hand-drawn with playful flourishes and varying weights, giving every word a custom-painted, mural-like personality. Whether you are a digital artist designing high-impact thumbnails or a crafter creating custom apparel, the Bouncy Graffiti Font delivers a professional, artisan-crafted aesthetic that is both nostalgic and trend-forward.</p>",
